  "title": "Super Simple Sweet Potato Dog Treats",
  "description": "These sweet potato dog treats made with applesauce, eggs, and whole wheat flour are budget-friendly chews for your pet and great for gift giving.",
  "authors": [
    "CookinBug"
  ],
